{
  "name": "fix-sqlite-delete-file-variable-limit",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-02T09:42:26.198Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-08T11:18:49.128Z",
  "description": "Hardens SQLite graph-store cleanup and collection-backed reads against SQLite's host-parameter limit by replacing file-local symbol expansion with subqueries and applying budget-aware worker-side chunking. It preserves atomic mutation, deterministic lookup, and empty-batch behavior, with regressions for large-file cleanup and direct upsert rollback after cleanup begins.",
